OL,3,AHow Kenyans got caught in $130m US
OL,4,Aghost student scam
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn May 2024, Francis Mogambi arrived in
OL,7,Fthe United States after winning the
OL,8,FDiversity Visa lottery, a programme
OL,9,Fthat gives people from around the world
OL,10,Fa chance to become permanent residents.
OL,12,FJust over two years later, the Kenyan
OL,13,Fnational found himself at the centre of
OL,14,Fa US investigation into an alleged
OL,15,Fnationwide scheme to defraud the
OL,16,Ffederal student aid system.
OL,18,FOn 19 October 2026, a grand jury in
OL,19,FNebraska indicted Mogambi on five
OL,20,Fcounts of theft of government money and
OL,21,Ffive counts of aggravated identity
OL,22,Ftheft.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
