OL,3,AHow Kenyans got caught in $130m US
OL,4,Aghost student scam
OL,5,
OL,6,FProsecutors allege that, between
OL,7,FNovember 2025 and May 2026, he worked
OL,8,Fwith associates in Kenya to steal the
OL,9,Fidentities of US citizens and use them
OL,10,Fto fraudulently enroll fictitious
OL,11,Fstudents in American colleges.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
